---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import "../styles/components/privacy-policy.css";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Kaili Stacey Tutoring"
  description="Privacy policy for Kaili Stacey Tutoring."
>
  <main class="main-content" id="Main" aria-label="Main content" role="main">
    <div class="privacy-container">
      <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to Home</a>

      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: January 20, 2026</p>

      <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
      <p>
        Kaili Stacey Tutoring ("we," "our," or "us") is committed to protecting your privacy. This
        Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when
        you visit our website
        <a href="https://kailistacey.com">https://kailistacey.com</a> (the "Site") and use our services.
      </p>
      <p>
        Please read this Privacy Policy carefully. If you do not agree with our policies and
        practices, please do not use our Site. By accessing and using this Site, you acknowledge
        that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by all the terms of this Privacy
        Policy.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>

      <h3>2.1 Information You Provide Directly</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Contact Form Data:</strong> Name, email address, subject, and message when you use our
          contact form. This information is processed through Netlify Forms.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Booking Information:</strong> When you book a session through our website, you connect
          your Google Calendar account to schedule tutoring sessions.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Communication Data:</strong> Any emails or messages you send us directly, including
          correspondence about tutoring services.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h3>2.2 Automatically Collected Information</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Analytics Data:</strong> Page views, referral source, device type, browser, and general
          location (anonymized) via Plausible Analytics. Plausible does not use cookies or collect personal
          identifiable information.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Error & Performance Data:</strong> Technical errors, performance metrics, and debugging
          information collected via Sentry for quality assurance purposes.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>IP Address:</strong> Your IP address when accessing Google Fonts and other third-party
          resources.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To respond to your inquiries and provide customer support</li>
        <li>To process and confirm session bookings and tutoring arrangements</li>
        <li>To improve our website functionality and user experience</li>
        <li>To send administrative notifications and updates (if you opt-in)</li>
        <li>To comply with legal obligations and protect against fraud or abuse</li>
        <li>To understand website performance and fix technical issues</li>
        <li>To track anonymized usage patterns through analytics</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. Third-Party Data Sharing</h2>
      <p>
        We share personal data with the following third-party service providers. We do not sell or
        intentionally share your personal information with third parties for marketing purposes.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Netlify Forms:</strong> Contact form submissions are handled by Netlify. Your data is
          subject to
          <a href="https://www.netlify.com/privacy">Netlify's Privacy Policy</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Google Calendar:</strong> Booking information is stored in your personal Google Calendar
          account. Your data is subject to <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy"
            >Google's Privacy Policy</a
          >.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Plausible Analytics:</strong> Website analytics are collected by Plausible Analytics.
          Plausible does not store personal data and is GDPR/CCPA compliant. See
          <a href="https://plausible.io/privacy">Plausible's Privacy Policy</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Sentry:</strong> Error tracking and performance monitoring via Sentry. See
          <a href="https://sentry.io/privacy">Sentry's Privacy Policy</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Google Fonts:</strong> Fonts are delivered by Google. Your IP address is shared with
          Google when loading fonts. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy"
            >Google's Privacy Policy</a
          >.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>5. Data Retention</h2>
      <p>
        We do not retain personal data on our servers. Here's how your data is handled by
        third-party services:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Contact Forms:</strong> Submitted form data is handled by Netlify Forms and retained
          according to Netlify's data retention policy. We do not store contact form submissions on our
          servers.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Booking Data:</strong> Stored in your Google Calendar account per Google's retention
          policy.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Analytics:</strong> Retained by Plausible Analytics per their data retention policy
          (typically 30 days for raw data).
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Error & Performance Data:</strong> Error reports, performance traces, and session replay
          data sent to Sentry are retained according to our Sentry project settings and Sentry's retention
          policy. We sample errors to reduce noise and typically retain data for 90 days.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Sentry & Sensitive Data</h3>
      <p>
        We use Sentry for error tracking and debugging. Sentry may collect technical information
        (errors, stack traces, browser logs) to help us fix issues. Sentry does not collect
        passwords, credit card information, or other sensitive personally identifiable information
        by default.
      </p>

      <h3>Opt-out / Contact</h3>
      <p>
        If you would like to opt out of error tracking or session replay for your sessions, contact
        us at
        <a href="mailto:kailistacey@gmail.com">kailistacey@gmail.com</a>. To request deletion of
        your personal data, please contact us with details about what data you'd like deleted.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Your Privacy Rights</h2>
      <p>Depending on your location, you may have the following rights:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Right to Access:</strong> Request a copy of the personal data we hold about you.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Right to Correct:</strong> Request corrections to inaccurate data.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Right to Delete:</strong> Request deletion of your personal data (subject to legal obligations
          and data retention policies of third-party services).
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Right to Opt-Out:</strong> Opt out of analytics tracking, error monitoring, or contact
          communications.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Right to Data Portability:</strong> Request your data in a portable format where technically
          feasible.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        To exercise any of these rights, please contact us at
        <a href="mailto:kailistacey@gmail.com">kailistacey@gmail.com</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Security</h2>
      <p>
        We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your personal data
        from unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction. However, no internet-based
        transmission is completely secure or error-free. Please use caution and safeguard your
        passwords.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Cookies and Tracking</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Plausible Analytics:</strong> We use Plausible Analytics for website analytics. Plausible
        does not use cookies or collect personally identifiable information. It is a privacy-respecting
        alternative to Google Analytics and is fully GDPR compliant.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Google Services:</strong> Google Fonts and Google Calendar may use cookies in accordance
        with Google's Cookie Policy. You can control cookie settings through your browser.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>This Site:</strong> Our website does not set cookies for tracking purposes. Session-based
        functionality (such as form state) may use browser storage (localStorage) for your convenience.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        Our services are not directed to children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal
        information from children under 13. If we become aware that we have inadvertently collected
        personal data from a child under 13, we will take steps to delete such information and
        terminate the child's account.
      </p>

      <h2>10. International Data Transfers</h2>
      <p>
        Your information may be transferred to, stored in, and processed in countries other than
        your country of residence, which may have data protection laws that differ from your home
        country. By using our Site, you consent to the transfer of your information to the United
        States and other countries for processing and storage.
      </p>

      <h2>11. Links to Third-Party Websites</h2>
      <p>
        Our website may contain links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for their
        privacy practices. We encourage you to review the privacy policies of any website before
        providing your personal information.
      </p>

      <h2>12. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices,
        technology, or legal requirements. We will notify you of any material changes by posting the
        new Privacy Policy on this page and updating the "Last Updated" date. Your continued use of
        the Site following the posting of revisions constitutes your acceptance of those changes.
      </p>

      <h2>13. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or our privacy practices, please contact us
        at:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Email:</strong>
          <a href="mailto:kailistacey@gmail.com">kailistacey@gmail.com</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Website:</strong>
          <a href="https://kailistacey.com">https://kailistacey.com</a>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p style="text-align: center; color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.9rem;">
        © 2025 Kaili Stacey Tutoring. All rights reserved.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
